WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From all fours, lower the forearms to the mat, elbows under the shoulders.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Interlace the fingers or keep the forearms parallel, palms pressing down.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Tuck the toes and lift the hips into an inverted V.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Press the chest toward the thighs and keep the neck long.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Lower the knees to exit, then rest in Child's Pose.
